LAIGO — LEGO Mosaic Builder
============================

Converts a photo into a LEGO mosaic: a color-quantized brick layout,
a Pick-a-Brick order list (uploadable to lego.com), and a step-by-step
PDF build guide.

Full project guide: CLAUDE.md
Checkout / payment reference: docs/ORDER_OPTIMIZER.md, docs/PRE_RELEASE_PAYMENT_CHECKLIST.md


Running locally
---------------

From the project root, in PowerShell:

    .venv\Scripts\activate.ps1
    uvicorn scripts.Main:app --reload

Open the Swagger UI at  http://127.0.0.1:8000/docs

The server MUST be started from the project root with the
package-qualified path (`scripts.Main:app`) — `cd scripts; uvicorn Main:app`
fails because `Main.py` uses relative imports.


First-time setup
----------------

1. Create the venv and install deps (project root).
2. Copy `.env` (committed defaults) and create `.env.secrets` (gitignored).
   Required keys live in docs/ORDER_OPTIMIZER.md §4.1; the checkout
   pipeline is gated off until those are present.
3. Apply DB migrations against your Neon DSN — see CLAUDE.md
   "Database migrations (alembic)" for the exact commands.


Basic usage
-----------

POST /generate  (multipart upload) — kicks off a mosaic job.
GET  /jobs/{job_id}                — poll job status.
GET  /jobs/{job_id}/download       — download the artifact zip when complete.

The zip contains:
  - order_list.json       (upload to lego.com Pick-a-Brick)
  - instructions.pdf      (step-by-step build guide)

Checkout endpoints (`/jobs/{id}/checkout/...`) are gated by the
checkout gate (see `GET /checkout/gate` and docs/CHECKOUT_AUDIT.md §10).


Running the tests
-----------------

From project root:

    .venv\Scripts\python.exe -m scripts.test_optimizer
    .venv\Scripts\python.exe -m scripts.test_gate_bypass
    .venv\Scripts\python.exe -m scripts.test_saga_state_machine
    .venv\Scripts\python.exe -m scripts.test_jobs_store_json
    .venv\Scripts\python.exe -m scripts.test_jobs_store_edge

Postgres-backed tests (need DB_BACKEND=postgres + a Neon DSN):

    .venv\Scripts\python.exe -m scripts.test_jobs_store_dispatch
    .venv\Scripts\python.exe -m scripts.test_phase_e_pg
    .venv\Scripts\python.exe -m scripts.test_reconcile_pg
